              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شکایت کرنا — shikāyat karnā — \"to complain\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The phrase, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شکایت کرنا (shikāyat karnā) joins shikāyat, \"a complaint\", and karnā, \"to do\". shikāyat is Arabic shikāya, \"complaint\", which reached Urdu through Persian (Lane, root sh-k-w); karnā comes from Sanskrit karoti, \"does\" (CDIAL 2814)."
            }
